Modifications (LGPL 2.1 section 2(b))
------------------------------------

Section 2(b) requires modified files to carry prominent notices stating
that you changed the files and the date of any change. This file is that
notice for the fork as a whole. We do not add banners inside upstream
CP932 sources: those files must stay CP932/ASCII (encoding-guard), and
extra comments would enlarge the game-source diff without changing
behavior. Git history remains the detailed record of each edit.

Dates below are commit dates (YYYY-MM-DD). New files added only by this
fork (for example under port/, scripts/, docs/, and CMake scaffolding)
are part of the modified work but are not listed as "changed upstream
files".

